@LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:9000

### Giltig ansökan → 201 Created
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-2010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Felaktigt personnummer → 400 Bad Request
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "9001012010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Belopp 0 → 400 Bad Request
POST {{LoanApplicationService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
